sequenceDiagram
    participant J as JIRA
    participant O as Omnigent
    participant H as Holodeck
    participant C as Coding Agent
    participant G as GitHub/CI
    participant P as Human

    J->>O: Ticket created
    Note over O: 1. Intake / select ticket
    O->>H: 2. Acquire env
    Note over H: 3. Strike workspace<br/>(golden → CoW clone,<br/>warm seeded DB)
    H->>C: Handle (exec + preview)
    Note over C: 4. Read ticket + code,<br/>write change
    C->>H: 5. Readiness / seed proof
    H->>C: Preview
    Note over C: Run migrate + tests
    C->>G: 6. Push branch → open PR
    P->>H: 7. Extend lease
    P->>G: Review preview, CI checks, approve
    P->>G: Merge
    G->>H: 9. Destroy (on merge)
    H->>O: 10. Report
    O->>J: Report
